name: Party Access Update Requested
description: A specific existing party must update access to its own timeline for
  an approved admission. The event is a request, not permission evidence or owner
  authority.
  Each request selects one exact lead or declared representative transport. The
  enclosing request map key is the transport selector; party remains its parent
  role. channel, accessPath and expectedAccessEntry belong to that transport.
  Readiness still requires coverage of every transport of the parent party.
